 622:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * <tr><td>4</td><td>DXnE</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>DXnF</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>DXnG</td></tr>
 623:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * </tr></table>
 624:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @return None
 625:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
 626:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Description</b><br>
 627:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Selects the data source for USIC input stage.\n\n
 628:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Selects the input data signal source among DXnA, DXnB.. DXnG for the input stage. The API can be
