1111:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Initializes the transmit FIFO. \n\n
1112:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Transmit FIFO is a subset of a common FIFO sized 64 words. This FIFO is shared between 2 channel
1113:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Each channel can share the FIFO for transmission and reception. \a data_pointer represents the s
1114:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * from where transmit data can be put, for the selected USIC channel. \a size represents the size 
1115:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 2. Since the FIFO is shared between 2 USIC channels, FIFO size should be carefully selected. A F
1116:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * event is generated when the FIFO filling level falls below the \a limit value.
1117:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
