1137:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The API is not to be called for initializing the transmit FIFO. The API shall be used for the 
1138:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * runtime change of transmit FIFO trigger limit. FIFO start position will not be affected on execu
