1181:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Disables the interrupt events related to transmit FIFO. \n\n
1182:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * By disabling the interrupt events, generation of interrupt is stopped. User can poll the event 
1183:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * flags from the status register using the API XMC_USIC_CH_TXFIFO_GetEvent(). 
1184:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Event bitmasks can be constructed using the enumeration @ref XMC_USIC_CH_TXFIFO_EVENT_CONF. For 
1185:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * multiple events, combine the events using bitwise OR operation.
1186:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
