1311:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * When the transmit FIFO is empty, data can be written to FIFO.
1312:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * When the last written word to the transmit FIFO is transmitted out of the FIFO, 
