1464:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h **** /**
1465:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param channel Pointer to USIC channel handler of type @ref XMC_USIC_CH_t \n
