  66:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h **** /**
  67:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * @addtogroup UART
  68:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * @brief Universal Asynchronous Receiver/Transmitter (UART) driver for XMC microcontroller family.
  69:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  *
  70:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * The UART driver uses Universal Serial Interface Channel(USIC) module to implement UART protocol.
  71:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * It provides APIs to configure USIC channel for UART communication. The driver enables the user
  72:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * in getting the status of UART protocol events, configuring interrupt service requests, protocol
  73:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * related parameter configuration etc.
  74:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * 
  75:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * UART driver features:
  76:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * -# Configuration structure XMC_UART_CH_CONFIG_t and initialization function XMC_UART_CH_Init()
  77:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * -# Enumeration of events with their bit masks @ref XMC_UART_CH_EVENT_t, @ref XMC_UART_CH_STATUS_
  78:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * -# Allows the selection of input source for the DX0 input stage using the API XMC_UART_CH_SetInp
  79:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * -# Allows configuration of baudrate using XMC_UART_CH_SetBaudrate() and configuration of data le
  80:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  XMC_UART_CH_SetWordLength() and XMC_UART_CH_SetFrameLength()
  81:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * -# Provides the status of UART protocol events, XMC_UART_CH_GetStatusFlag()
  82:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * -# Allows transmission of data using XMC_UART_CH_Transmit() and gets received data using XMC_UAR
  83:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * 
  84:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_uart.h ****  * @{
